## Local Working Agreement
- Read this file before non-trivial work.
- Use Composition API with `<script setup>` only.
- Props must have type declarations.
- Emits must be declared with types.
- Keep components focused — one responsibility each.
- Tests mandatory for new components, composables, stores.
- Use `data-testid` for test selectors.
- No `any` in TypeScript — use proper types.

## Component Conventions
- File naming: PascalCase.vue
- Composable naming: use*.ts
- Store naming: domain.ts
- Props: typed with `defineProps<{...}>()`
- Emits: typed with `defineEmits<{...}>()`

